  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3415,
      "text": "This is the promise of Allah. Allah never breaks His promise, but most people do not know.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 405,
      "ruku": 349,
      "hizbQuarter": 162,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3416,
      "text": "They only know the apparent life of this world, but they are heedless of the Hereafter.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 405,
      "ruku": 349,
      "hizbQuarter": 162,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3417,
      "text": "Do they not reflect on themselves? Allah did not create the heavens and earth and all that is between them except for a true purpose and for an appointed term, but most people deny the meeting with their Lord.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 405,
      "ruku": 349,
      "hizbQuarter": 162,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3418,
      "text": "Have they not traveled through the land to see how was the end of those who came before them? They were more powerful than them, and they tilled the land and built it more than these people have ever built. Their messengers came to them with clear proofs. It was not Allah Who wronged them, but it was they who wronged themselves.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 405,
      "ruku": 349,
      "hizbQuarter": 162,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3419,
      "text": "Then the end of the evildoers was utterly evil because they rejected the signs of Allah and used to ridicule them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 405,
      "ruku": 349,
      "hizbQuarter": 162,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3420,
      "text": "Allah brings the creation into being, then He will repeat it[5], then to Him you will be returned.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 405,
      "ruku": 350,
      "hizbQuarter": 162,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3421,
      "text": "On the Day when the Hour begins, the wicked will be in utmost despair.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 405,
      "ruku": 350,
      "hizbQuarter": 162,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3422,
      "text": "They will have no intercessors among their [so-called] partners, rather they will disown those partners.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 405,
      "ruku": 350,
      "hizbQuarter": 162,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3423,
      "text": "On the Day when the Hour begins, the people will then be separated:",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
